  "body": "All offers to be considered!\r\n* Separate living area for flexible family use\r\n* Central air conditioning plus extra heat pump for year-round comfort\r\n* Private outdoor setting with generous covered timber deck\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, dining and family living with seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n* Spacious master bedroom with its own ensuite\r\n* Approx. 199sqm floor area on a 525sqm section\r\n* Well-established landscaping providing privacy and a relaxed outdoor setting\r\n* Conveniently positioned close to KingsWay School, Silverdale School, cafes, parks and everyday amenities\r\n\r\nIf space, sunshine and single-level living are high on your list, this is one worth seeing.\r\n\r\nSet in the sought-after Millwater community, this beautifully presented four-bedroom home delivers the kind of spacious, easy-care layout that works exceptionally well for families. With two separate living areas, generous outdoor space and excellent indoor-outdoor flow, there's room for everyone to spread out, come together and enjoy everyday life.\r\n\r\nInside, the home is bright and welcoming, with natural light enhancing the generous living spaces. The open-plan kitchen and dining area forms the heart of the home, with a generous island bench and plenty of room for family meals, entertaining and relaxed gatherings.\r\n\r\nThe adjoining family living area opens effortlessly to the large, covered timber deck, creating an impressive extension of the home's living space. Whether you're hosting friends, enjoying a weekend barbecue or simply relaxing outdoors, this private setting is designed to be enjoyed in every season.\r\n\r\nA second separate living area provides valuable flexibility - perfect as a quieter retreat, children's space or additional family room. The four bedrooms are well positioned away from the main living areas, with the spacious master suite enjoying its own ensuite.\r\n\r\nOutside, the established gardens and private setting complement the generous 525sqm section, while the double garage and ample driveway space add everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nBest of all, you're right where you want to be. From this established Millwater location, KingsWay School and Silverdale School are within easy reach, while cafes, shops and everyday amenities are just minutes away.\r\n\r\nSpacious, sunny and genuinely designed for family living, this is a single-level Millwater home that deserves to be on your viewing list.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes. Learn more at www.vinsonamyandco.nz.",
